  "https://deims.org/a76adcb2-88ec-448e-94a4-bbf43b47c9b0"
 ],
 "Site Description": "Bosland consists of 3 municipalities Lommel, Overpelt and Hechtel-Eksel with a total area of 21982ha. From this area, 9500 ha is nature and forest which consists largely of coniferous stands on sandy soil intermixed with remnants of heathland and landdunes.",
